.SH "Field Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "sc_array_t p6est_ghost::ghosts"

.PP
An array of column-layers which make up the ghost layer around \fI\fBp6est\fP\fP\&. Their piggy3 data member is filled with their owner's tree and local number (cumulative over trees)\&. Quadrants are ordered in \fCp4est_quadrant_compare_piggy\fP order\&. These are quadrants inside the neighboring tree, i\&.e\&., \fCp4est_quadrant_is_inside\fP is true for the quadrant and the neighboring tree\&. array of p2est_quadrant_t type 
.SS "\fBp4est_locidx_t\fP* p6est_ghost::mirror_proc_fronts"

.PP
like mirror_proc_mirrors, but limited to the outermost octants\&. This is NULL until p4est_ghost_expand is called 
.SS "sc_array_t p6est_ghost::mirrors"

.PP
An array of local quadrants that touch the parallel boundary from the inside, i\&.e\&., that are ghosts in the perspective of at least one other processor\&. The storage convention is the same as for \fCghosts\fP above\&. array of p4est_quadrant_t type 

